WEBVTT

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:17.080
Episode 19

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.600
You don't feel well, why are you here?

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:35.540
Let's go back

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:48.260
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:44.460
Let's go

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:46.940
I was waiting for you, I wanted to talk

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:58.360
Translators: Nemie, Kaia, tamaramin

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:53.560
I can't

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:57.200
return to your chambers

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:08.460
Beta Editor: Sana

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:04.220
Don't do this to me because of Chae Ryung

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:06.920
She fooled you

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:10.720
She was never sincere with you

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:17.200
I'm fine

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.430
I'm fine

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:24.440
Chae Ryung...

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:29.030
was sincere with me

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:31.050
No matter what you say

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:34.660
she was sincere

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:35.750
So what?

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:39.660
Will you trust her more than me?

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:44.440
I want to leave the palace

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:48.890
I want to leave this place

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:51.480
I can't take it anymore...

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:55.650
it's tolerable

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.130
What about me?

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:02.690
Do you think I'll let you go?

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:04.700
I will become the darkness

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.160
You

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:08.500
And I'll wrap you in myself

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:08.990
you can never leave me

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:12.250
Just for a day, just like that

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:16.220
Stay with me

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:19.950
And I will become the moon

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:23.850
I will be the light for one

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:30.120
Wherever I am, wherever I go, I will come

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:35.370
You are my love, believe me

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:39.650
You're the only one I need so much

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:43.370
I look at you from afar

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:46.820
And I'll turn away again

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:51.550
Here I confess to you alone

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:55.450
With all my strength I

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.490
Can you completely abandon your brother and family?

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:58.670
Love, love, love

00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:58.490
If you only become my empress...

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:06.100
Can you hear my heart now?

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:03.620
I will make our child crown prince

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:11.410
Koryo will belong to my son

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:24.050
Please find and notify Chae Ryung's family

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:26.310
This is all I have

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:30.710
If they need anything else,
I will do anything to give it to them

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.880
You shouldn't do this

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:35.120
I'm worried you'll anger the emperor

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:39.440
She cared about her family even when she was dying

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.650
Asked me for help

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:49.090
The Emperor won't mind

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:58.240
Great job

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:00.330
Hello Chi Mon

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:07.720
Chae Ryung died

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:12.140
Really?

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.180
You shouldn't be so calm

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:17.110
It's your fault

00:04:17.970 --> 00:04:19.210
Mine?

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.640
You've apparently gone crazy

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:24.060
You'll regret this

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:26.860
This is how she was treated...

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:32.160
I promise one day you'll regret it

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:36.790
Since becoming the emperor's mistress,

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:38.940
I thought I could do whatever I wanted

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:40.900
- So?
- Mistress?

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:53.080
Your Majesty

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:04.340
Did you call me?

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.900
I heard from Chi Mon

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:10.920
I must officially declare you a concubine

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:12.400
There's no need for this

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:14.110
It's better to be called that than a mistress

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:15.240
I don't want to hear it

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:19.460
You will be my wife, second only to the Empress

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:23.740
When your baby is born,
you will be proclaimed second empress

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:29.010
I don't want to leave this place because of the title.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:32.270
Discuss with Chi Mon what title you want

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:33.460
Your Majesty

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:35.610
You know you can't, so don't be stubborn

00:05:41.810 --> 00:05:43.140
Let's not fight

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:46.540
Have you forgotten how long we were apart?

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:52.040
I just want to say that we shouldn't waste our time arguing.

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:13.340
Does he want to read "Fundamentals of Politics in the Zhenguan Era" in its entirety?

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:15.650
I don't know his intentions

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.900
I guess I should give him a hawk

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:30.380
So agile that it will be good at hunting

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:35.410
I don't know what he's up to

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:38.180
He wants to go hunting

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:40.540
We need to contribute to this

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:44.160
Brother, you know our 4th brother well

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:47.480
You can't trust him and let your guard down around him

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:50.020
You must cut off his arms and legs

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:53.380
Are you talking about Baek Ah?

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:56.040
He still hangs around that gisaeng

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:58.720
It will be easy to remove him from the emperor

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:05.570
What's holding you back now?

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:07.730
We have already found you a foster family

00:07:07.730 --> 00:07:10.130
My mother is waiting to meet you

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:14.620
Is it all because of what happened that time?

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:19.420
I already said that we will free all the slaves from Baekje

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:21.240
This won't happen again

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:32.840
escaped slaves

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:31.720
Why don't the people of Hupakje pay tribute?

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:33.690
Why are they like this? God

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:55.870
Baekje slaves have already set fire to 10 houses

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.650
Many members of powerful clans died

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:01.870
We can't just sit back

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:05.480
The clans ask you to send soldiers

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:09.010
If we do this, there will definitely be casualties

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:11.250
Among them there will be not only slaves

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:15.290
If people from other countries join, there will be chaos in Goryeo

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:17.460
First of all, you must protect the clans!

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:21.010
Their lives will be at risk
until the soldiers come to help them

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:23.440
They have already begun to gather an army themselves

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:24.970
You must do this, Your Majesty!

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:27.640
We must save the clans
which are the foundation of this nation

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:32.840
Then

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:38.790
soldiers must carry spears
without sharp tips and wooden swords

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:43.500
I took the throne not long ago.
I want to avoid bloodshed if possible

00:08:44.610 --> 00:08:49.130
I believe that 13th Prince Baek Ah will lead them

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:53.810
Baek Ah knows nothing about military and combat activities

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:54.970
Why him?

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:57.440
There are rumors that the Emperor doesn't care about the people of Goryeo,

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:01.480
all he cares about is Prince Baek Ah of Silla and the people from Hubaekje

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:04.230
On top of that, Prince Baek Ah

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:08.190
marries their court lady Hubaekje, adopted by a family from Goryeo

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.260
I have already agreed to this

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:15.270
This could also mean that someone close to the emperor is being manipulated by a man from Hubaekje

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:17.570
What funny accusations

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:19.890
These accusations could turn out to be true in a blink of an eye.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:25.400
It's called "rumors"... or "word of mouth"

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.270
I won't allow this

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:37.760
You always walked only with a lute,
how can you handle a sword?

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:40.580
I don't like how Woo Hee is suspected because of her background.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:41.790
Because of us

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:45.370
you have a lot of problems, your majesty

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.600
It would be better if I took a step forward

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:54.900
So that the clans do not interfere,

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.980
looks like they need to leave that area

00:09:57.850 --> 00:10:01.510
If you take the side of either the clans or the slaves,

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:02.560
this will cause problems

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:04.090
I'm not going to die

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:06.410
If we leave it like this...

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:09.770
the clans will control us,
and the throne will be in danger

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.010
I'll be fine

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:35.090
I'm still looking at you from the outside

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:45.360
It seemed to me that you are my love

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:50.090
I kept thinking that you feel the same way

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:55.810
Although you look the other way

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:55.130
Won't you regret it?

00:10:57.060 --> 00:11:05.340
Like the wind, like dust

00:10:57.450 --> 00:10:58.860
I pretended to be strong

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:01.440
I don't know what could happen to me

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:06.570
You will have a wife, you must survive

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:11.090
I can't catch you and see you

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:11.810
I don't want to become a widow

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:19.740
Do you remember: I love, I love

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:20.530
When I return

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:26.010
I believe there was love, I’ll call it fate

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:24.460
let's get married

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:33.790
And I can only answer you:

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:32.360
You are mine...

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.260
life partner

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:39.900
Hold me if I'm swinging

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:40.700
Right now I really want to not be associated with Hubaekje

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:43.380
my love

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:45.850
I am yours with all my heart

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:50.310
my love

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:55.660
Out of the way!

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:58.060
Forward!

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:01.400
There's something here!

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:09.540
I, the Emperor of Goryeo, want to promise the people of Baekje

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:13.870
Slaves will not be touched

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:16.930
To resolve this issue,

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:21.580
I will weigh everything carefully and make the right decision

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:26.960
People who were forcibly enslaved during the war will be freed

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:33.300
Foreigners who were turned into slaves
will be restored to their position

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:34.980
All this will be strictly observed

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:40.610
Slaves who were forcibly taken away will be returned to their homelands

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:43.190
They will be exempt from paying tribute for a certain time

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:48.860
Down with the difference in attitude towards people depending on their origin

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:50.660
You can even become officials

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:53.720
All of you will be subjects of Goryeo

00:12:56.810 --> 00:13:00.950
They always lie about the same thing!

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:04.780
- Yeah!
- You can't fool us! No!

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:08.170
They take us for dogs and pigs!

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:10.270
Let's. Forward!

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:12.440
Yes!

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:37.400
You are in exile, why are you here?

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:38.620
Lost my mind

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:42.110
Tell the emperor to do as he pleases, I'm not afraid of anything

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:59.570
I told you he would sentence you to death

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.560
He could have sent me

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.290
Please don't die

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:10.880
You may come back wounded

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.200
but don't die

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:17.520
I can't stand it

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:24.690
Did you receive what Hae Soo asked me to give you?

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:27.340
A hairpin?

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:28.730
Yes

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:31.730
But I don't know what it means
because she didn't send the letter...

00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:33.180
She also asked to convey:

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:35.920
"I want it"

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:38.280
"I want this"?

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:41.110
Did Hae Soo really say that?

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:44.980
Yes, that's what she said

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:47.510
"Hae Soo

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:50.870
really wants this"

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:53.720
I asked you to tell me

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:57.470
I don't know what she wants

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:00.310
Help her

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:03.330
I don't know what will happen to me

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:08.520
You must remain a good friend to her.

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.310
And for the emperor too

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:14.090
It's hard for him

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:17.000
Should you worry about others now?

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:19.960
No one even came to see you off

00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:23.190
What about that courtier from the gisaeng house?

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:26.950
I told Woo Hee that it would be better if she didn't come.

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:33.600
Please take care of yourself brother

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:08.190
Later Three Korean States: Reunification of Goryeo, Baekje and Silla

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:14.330
Woo Hee...

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.840
Princess! This is Princess Woo Hee!

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:23.900
Princess Woo Hee, be careful! Get off there

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:30.420
You can't stand there

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:32.080
Woo Hee!

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:44.080
Stop

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:54.020
You won't...?

00:16:57.150 --> 00:16:58.320
No need

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:01.770
Turn away

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:04.540
Look away!

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:22.420
If you see

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:29.040
you'll never forget

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:39.990
Woo Hee!

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.880
I thought I could forget about everything and move on with my life

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:50.010
I wanted to abandon my parents

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:54.710
But I can't turn away from my people who consider me a mother

00:17:56.350 --> 00:18:00.820
I don't think I can live like this

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:11.540
The flower will fall to the ground, it withered

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:06.600
Goryeo and Baekje

00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:10.030
Gyung Hwon and Wang Gun

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:13.550
Their sins...

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:25.440
He will be all alone, so sad

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:17.200
I will pay for them with my life

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:24.420
Perhaps this is the reason I was born

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:39.380
The sky will lose its stars, it will instantly become sad

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.240
Beck A,

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:31.100
Woo Hee!

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:32.480
i love you

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:36.060
Only you

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:40.770
my life partner

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:53.830
And suddenly it starts crying like a little rain

00:18:53.830 --> 00:19:07.220
It feels like a flower blooms and then withers

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:22.180
Tell me with the wind, please

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:43.680
With the appearance of snow, all dreams will come true

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:58.160
With all my heart I believe so, they are sincere

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:11.780
Do you know my heart that it always waits like this?

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:06.960
In order not to forget about her, you must not destroy yourself

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:10.670
Why didn't she tell me?

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:27.980
If so, come back

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:19.120
I must have made her like this

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:24.180
Come to think of it, I was too greedy

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:30.120
Subjects of the fallen nation and former gisaeng,

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:32.300
orphan

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:36.740
I knew about her past

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:40.920
I was so proud to love her

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:43.650
It was narcissistic

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:47.400
I didn't try to understand Woo Hee's true feelings

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:54.050
Why was she sad, why was she unhappy?

00:20:56.890 --> 00:20:59.540
"Why is your smile so short-lived?"

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:03.640
I never asked her about this

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:08.930
It was fleeting love

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:11.980
In this situation, Woo Hee behaved badly

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:17.940
We gave her our hearts

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:21.420
And she

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:25.540
wasn't selfish enough

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:29.460
She's bad

00:21:38.470 --> 00:21:41.030
The Emperor knew about this

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:46.640
Really?

00:22:02.240 --> 00:22:03.860
Your face doesn't look good

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:06.970
I will send a doctor to you, you will be treated

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:09.560
Woo Hee asked to post that decree

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:13.370
That means you made a deal with her, right?

00:22:14.710 --> 00:22:16.550
I didn't know she was going to die

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.380
She said I could save you if I wrote it

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:24.100
It all happened when I found out that she was Princess Hubaekje

00:22:26.330 --> 00:22:28.090
I wanted to save you

00:22:28.940 --> 00:22:31.430
It was like grabbing a rotten rope, but I wrote it anyway

00:22:32.360 --> 00:22:35.360
I didn't know it would turn out this way, but even if I had known...

00:22:36.380 --> 00:22:37.760
the same thing would happen

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:40.700
For me

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:44.070
you are more important

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:46.490
I know this

00:22:49.670 --> 00:22:51.090
I understand this

00:22:52.740 --> 00:22:54.780
but it's hard for me to accept it

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:01.310
It's hard to be by your side

00:23:18.680 --> 00:23:20.140
Don't do this

00:23:20.140 --> 00:23:21.360
I...

00:23:23.570 --> 00:23:25.020
was wrong

00:23:30.460 --> 00:23:31.740
No, I

00:23:33.380 --> 00:23:37.060
I'm sorry I couldn't protect you

00:23:39.020 --> 00:23:40.850
Please live long and healthy,

00:23:43.380 --> 00:23:44.480
brother

00:23:52.420 --> 00:23:53.700
Beck Ah!

00:23:55.160 --> 00:23:56.820
Beck A!!!

00:24:35.380 --> 00:24:38.060
Are you sure of your decision?

00:24:39.170 --> 00:24:40.470
Completely

00:25:11.070 --> 00:25:12.820
You mentioned you were going hunting

00:25:12.820 --> 00:25:14.980
I have a hunting hawk for you

00:25:15.680 --> 00:25:18.800
I really like hunting hawks

00:25:25.560 --> 00:25:28.490
This is an indicator of brotherly love

00:25:28.490 --> 00:25:31.580
They say brotherly love is the foundation of humanity

00:25:32.090 --> 00:25:35.280
Wow! That's why brothers are the best in the world

00:25:35.280 --> 00:25:38.590
Family harmony means
harmony in the country, don’t you think?

00:26:08.610 --> 00:26:10.230
Isn't that a dead hawk?

00:26:10.230 --> 00:26:13.610
The Emperor was given a dead hawk?

00:26:13.610 --> 00:26:15.810
You cursed the emperor!

00:26:16.480 --> 00:26:18.680
We can't leave it like this!

00:26:19.690 --> 00:26:20.740
Your Majesty...

00:26:21.550 --> 00:26:22.780
This is a misunderstanding

00:26:22.780 --> 00:26:26.010
Something happened while carrying the hawk...

00:26:26.010 --> 00:26:29.970
You brought it yourself, who do you blame?

00:26:37.050 --> 00:26:38.970
Did you want to curse the emperor?

00:26:41.650 --> 00:26:44.640
So this is treason?

00:26:45.410 --> 00:26:47.930
Everyone understands that this is so!

00:26:47.930 --> 00:26:50.780
It's true, Your Majesty

00:26:55.860 --> 00:26:58.030
Your Majesty, you misunderstood!

00:26:58.030 --> 00:27:00.070
I was set up, Your Majesty!

00:27:08.780 --> 00:27:10.840
If this is treason,

00:27:12.340 --> 00:27:14.330
you must pay for it with your life

00:27:39.640 --> 00:27:40.750
Empress!

00:27:41.480 --> 00:27:42.790
Have you come?

00:27:42.790 --> 00:27:46.360
Uka was framed, he could die

00:27:47.040 --> 00:27:50.560
I heard he made a serious mistake that can't be undone

00:27:52.090 --> 00:27:54.960
You must save your brother

00:27:57.310 --> 00:27:58.610
I refuse

00:28:00.630 --> 00:28:01.810
Your Majesty...

00:28:04.960 --> 00:28:09.010
I can't get involved in politics just to cover up my brother's crimes.

00:28:09.010 --> 00:28:11.210
His crimes are very serious

00:28:11.800 --> 00:28:14.950
The elders from Hwangju are watching me closely

00:28:16.060 --> 00:28:17.760
Don't expect much from me

00:28:19.180 --> 00:28:20.300
"Only"?

00:28:20.830 --> 00:28:24.260
You use the word "only"
when it comes to your brother's life?!

00:28:26.730 --> 00:28:29.450
I am now the empress

00:28:30.250 --> 00:28:32.760
I value my family and don't want to lose my brother

00:28:33.390 --> 00:28:35.230
But I have to take a broader view

00:28:38.520 --> 00:28:40.430
You must let me go, mother

00:29:26.340 --> 00:29:28.050
Sorry Uka

00:29:30.200 --> 00:29:32.190
I'm sure he was framed

00:29:32.850 --> 00:29:34.260
Let him live

00:29:40.080 --> 00:29:41.180
Your Majesty

00:29:45.520 --> 00:29:47.300
Don't you know you can't kneel?

00:29:47.300 --> 00:29:50.400
You may lose the ability to walk, get up

00:29:51.610 --> 00:29:54.330
You said you wouldn't touch your brothers

00:29:55.300 --> 00:29:56.470
Don't do this

00:29:57.680 --> 00:29:59.800
I know you care about princes

00:30:00.880 --> 00:30:06.020
But I don't like that you came to me and begged for his salvation on your knees

00:30:08.830 --> 00:30:11.050
- Get up
- The Man Who Killed the Hawk -

00:30:13.950 --> 00:30:15.470
it was you, Your Majesty

00:30:17.660 --> 00:30:21.020
You did this on purpose, putting Uk's life in danger

00:30:32.630 --> 00:30:33.660
So what?

00:30:34.950 --> 00:30:36.160
Shouldn't I have done that?

00:30:38.850 --> 00:30:42.910
Wook killed our elder brother and Eun.
He chased Baek Ah

00:30:43.420 --> 00:30:46.430
Tried to kill me and divide us

00:30:46.430 --> 00:30:49.150
- He’s such a person!
-If you kill anyone else,

00:30:49.150 --> 00:30:51.500
it will definitely come back to you

00:30:52.280 --> 00:30:55.100
If you are so cruel in your punishments,

00:30:55.540 --> 00:30:57.970
everyone will consider you an enemy

00:31:00.220 --> 00:31:01.490
In the future...

00:31:02.350 --> 00:31:07.120
I wouldn't want you to be remembered as a bloody ruler

00:31:08.770 --> 00:31:12.290
Okay. I'll let him live

00:31:14.960 --> 00:31:17.630
He will be punished by exile to his hometown

00:31:18.790 --> 00:31:22.610
He will not be allowed to take a single step out of his home

00:31:24.860 --> 00:31:26.790
He wanted to take over Goryeo,

00:31:26.790 --> 00:31:29.400
but now his home will become his whole world

00:31:29.400 --> 00:31:33.070
In that house... he will suffocate

00:31:33.070 --> 00:31:35.990
He'll have to live there until his heart rots

00:31:47.720 --> 00:31:48.800
If you think about it

00:31:50.030 --> 00:31:55.560
this punishment suits him better,
than immediate execution

00:32:55.710 --> 00:32:57.550
Do you have time to play with flowers?

00:32:58.200 --> 00:33:00.060
You're disgusting

00:33:07.730 --> 00:33:09.800
I heard about Uke

00:33:11.370 --> 00:33:15.960
I know what you're going through
on this matter, Your Majesty

00:33:15.960 --> 00:33:21.310
Since childhood he never refused me

00:33:23.390 --> 00:33:26.000
I'm curious if I ruined his life

00:33:26.000 --> 00:33:27.560
I'm very worried about this

00:33:28.520 --> 00:33:30.380
I betrayed him to become empress

00:33:31.260 --> 00:33:34.050
I wanted the two of us to rule this palace

00:33:34.620 --> 00:33:36.760
I pushed him away too much

00:33:40.480 --> 00:33:41.890
However...

00:33:42.860 --> 00:33:45.710
It's not me who completely changed my brother

00:33:48.920 --> 00:33:50.390
It was you

00:33:52.050 --> 00:33:54.420
- What?
- I heard from my brother,

00:33:55.280 --> 00:33:57.960
what did you tell him to beware of the 4th prince

00:33:57.960 --> 00:34:01.900
You told him not to get in Prince Wang So's way or he might die.

00:34:06.130 --> 00:34:07.220
This is because

00:34:08.880 --> 00:34:12.700
what did I tell him to be wary of the 4th prince?

00:34:12.700 --> 00:34:17.720
After he heard this, he believed that the 4th prince would become emperor

00:34:18.720 --> 00:34:20.820
He had feelings for you

00:34:21.560 --> 00:34:24.970
What he hated most was that you saw the future emperor in another man.

00:34:28.240 --> 00:34:30.580
I put pressure on Uka

00:34:31.030 --> 00:34:33.250
But it was you who became the hammer that hammered the nail

00:34:36.580 --> 00:34:38.670
It all started with you

00:34:40.580 --> 00:34:45.810
I decided to kill my brothers and become emperor

00:34:48.200 --> 00:34:49.870
All because of you...

00:34:51.230 --> 00:34:54.570
You helped Seo hide his scar so he could take my place.

00:34:56.430 --> 00:34:58.790
Because he took what belonged to me...

00:35:00.520 --> 00:35:02.360
Beware of Prince Wang So

00:35:02.360 --> 00:35:05.310
Avoid him. You can't stop him

00:35:05.310 --> 00:35:06.520
and if you try...

00:35:07.960 --> 00:35:09.760
You will all die

00:35:19.430 --> 00:35:21.250
It's all my fault

00:35:21.710 --> 00:35:24.610
If only you hadn't told him to beware of the 4th prince

00:35:24.610 --> 00:35:29.150
If you hadn't intervened and said that the 4th prince would be emperor

00:35:30.010 --> 00:35:33.230
Uk would not have changed beyond recognition

00:35:36.490 --> 00:35:38.420
You ruined everything

00:35:39.360 --> 00:35:42.080
What's even more shameful is that you're still alive

00:35:59.870 --> 00:36:02.000
This is my favorite, Su

00:36:02.000 --> 00:36:03.630
And white tea is mine

00:36:06.410 --> 00:36:08.360
Is it all my fault?

00:36:49.340 --> 00:36:51.190
Draw it so I look exactly like you

00:36:51.190 --> 00:36:55.310
It is necessary that, looking at the picture, people get the impression that they are looking at me

00:36:55.310 --> 00:36:58.060
I thought we would draw something
what will you look like when you get old?

00:36:58.060 --> 00:36:59.570
You don't sit on your throne

00:36:59.590 --> 00:37:01.830
People won't know whether you're an emperor or a prince

00:37:01.830 --> 00:37:03.150
They will be confused

00:37:03.150 --> 00:37:06.260
I'm very young now. Why hang a picture after my death?

00:37:10.640 --> 00:37:12.010
I want to give it to someone

00:37:15.980 --> 00:37:18.360
You can't! It is forbidden!

00:37:27.220 --> 00:37:28.820
I have come to see His Majesty

00:37:32.170 --> 00:37:34.600
And you boldly ignore the imperial decrees

00:37:35.380 --> 00:37:37.760
You probably dream about death

00:37:37.760 --> 00:37:41.060
I came because I need your permission, Your Majesty.

00:37:42.080 --> 00:37:45.270
You wouldn't have accepted me if I had warned you in advance

00:37:48.030 --> 00:37:49.780
This is the decree that the late emperor left

00:38:03.310 --> 00:38:07.880
I consent to the marriage of Prince Jeong and Court Lady Hae Soo

00:38:09.930 --> 00:38:12.170
Thanks to you, the border has calmed down

00:38:12.970 --> 00:38:15.640
Before I leave, I'll give you whatever you want as a reward.

00:38:17.180 --> 00:38:18.580
Anything I want?

00:38:18.580 --> 00:38:21.000
If it's not a throne, you can call it anything

00:38:22.210 --> 00:38:23.570
If so...

00:38:27.440 --> 00:38:30.190
there is something that I have been wanting for a very long time

00:38:38.090 --> 00:38:39.240
It's fake

00:38:41.290 --> 00:38:42.430
This is a lie

00:38:47.790 --> 00:38:51.100
You have ascended to the throne thanks to the last decree of the late Emperor, Your Majesty

00:38:51.100 --> 00:38:53.810
How can you treat his decrees in this way?

00:38:54.920 --> 00:38:58.780
You can compare this document with others written by the late emperor

00:38:58.780 --> 00:39:02.040
You will be convinced that he wrote it

00:39:02.040 --> 00:39:05.550
Even if it's not fake, I won't allow it

00:39:07.600 --> 00:39:09.450
You can't marry Hae Soo

00:39:09.450 --> 00:39:13.440
Since the late emperor has given his consent, there is nothing to stop me

00:39:13.440 --> 00:39:16.380
There's no one in this place
who wouldn't know about our relationship

00:39:16.380 --> 00:39:19.530
Do you still want to marry her?

00:39:20.950 --> 00:39:22.970
Stop this nonsense

00:39:22.970 --> 00:39:26.460
Hae Soo is neither an empress nor an official imperial concubine.

00:39:26.460 --> 00:39:28.070
She's not your wife either

00:39:28.070 --> 00:39:32.340
There's no reason why she can't marry me

00:39:33.210 --> 00:39:36.820
I also informed the ministers about this

00:39:37.820 --> 00:39:40.580
I said that I am waiting for your permission for our marriage

00:39:44.360 --> 00:39:45.700
Chi Mon

00:39:48.850 --> 00:39:52.080
Punish Prince Jeong for violating the expulsion order...

00:39:52.080 --> 00:39:53.290
Hae Soo wants it

00:39:56.930 --> 00:39:57.940
What?

00:39:58.880 --> 00:40:00.180
You can ask her

00:40:01.120 --> 00:40:06.760
Hae Soo wants to marry me

00:40:16.640 --> 00:40:18.290
This soap was made recently, right?

00:40:19.850 --> 00:40:22.090
It breaks easily

00:40:23.250 --> 00:40:25.400
For wives, use a floral scent,

00:40:25.430 --> 00:40:29.820
and herbs and mint for the emperor and princes

00:40:29.820 --> 00:40:30.840
Okay

00:40:37.920 --> 00:40:39.210
Jeong says

00:40:41.610 --> 00:40:43.040
that he will marry you

00:40:44.720 --> 00:40:48.120
He has permission from the late emperor to marry you

00:40:48.120 --> 00:40:49.680
Did you know about this?

00:40:52.090 --> 00:40:55.520
When did he receive this permission?

00:40:55.520 --> 00:40:56.860
September, Year of the Monkey

00:40:57.570 --> 00:41:00.590
When he returned after
how he won the battle against the Khitans in Khwai

00:41:05.340 --> 00:41:09.180
Jeong said you want it too

00:41:09.180 --> 00:41:10.700
I know it's not true

00:41:11.610 --> 00:41:14.970
- I can declare that this is a fake...
- I want this

00:41:20.560 --> 00:41:23.350
It is a great crime to go against the wishes of the late emperor.

00:41:23.350 --> 00:41:26.310
If you don't agree to this, someone will definitely

00:41:27.020 --> 00:41:29.510
will challenge your right to sit on the throne

00:41:34.200 --> 00:41:39.040
When we are not together, we always passionately desire each other

00:41:40.650 --> 00:41:43.070
My heart breaks just thinking about you

00:41:44.650 --> 00:41:45.970
But now...

00:41:48.010 --> 00:41:50.350
When I can watch you every day...

00:41:52.710 --> 00:41:54.820
Sometimes I even despise you

00:41:56.130 --> 00:41:57.400
Do you despise?

00:41:57.620 --> 00:41:59.180
If we continue like this,

00:41:59.180 --> 00:42:02.770
absolutely certain, one day only contempt and disgust will remain

00:42:03.600 --> 00:42:05.130
I don't want this

00:42:05.130 --> 00:42:08.840
I prefer to leave now

00:42:11.220 --> 00:42:12.940
I will never allow this

00:42:52.630 --> 00:42:56.420
People are starting to suspect you of the right to inherit the throne, but you don’t care?!

00:42:59.030 --> 00:43:01.850
You made me turn my back on my family and brother

00:43:03.040 --> 00:43:06.360
But you yourself can’t refuse Hae Soo?

00:43:06.360 --> 00:43:07.460
That's right

00:43:09.030 --> 00:43:11.030
I won't let Hae Soo go

00:43:13.760 --> 00:43:16.320
How long will you continue to say this?

00:43:16.840 --> 00:43:18.250
Let's wait and see

00:43:20.520 --> 00:43:22.580
You may lose your throne

00:43:24.090 --> 00:43:25.870
I won't let this happen

00:43:58.700 --> 00:44:00.210
You can climb

00:44:01.010 --> 00:44:04.880
The Emperor has decided to spare your life

00:44:05.980 --> 00:44:11.360
I hide my tears deep inside

00:44:08.330 --> 00:44:12.110
What if people start to suspect you too?

00:44:12.210 --> 00:44:18.010
I want to forget everything about you

00:44:15.360 --> 00:44:16.610
This is not because

00:44:18.490 --> 00:44:20.650
that you still have feelings for me

00:44:18.760 --> 00:44:25.310
It's time for us to leave the fate that brought us together

00:44:22.440 --> 00:44:26.220
You know I would do this for anyone who was in your shoes

00:44:25.310 --> 00:44:33.660
Even though we will have to live in tears

00:44:27.380 --> 00:44:29.050
The Emperor knows it too

00:44:33.780 --> 00:44:39.780
As if a free wind will carry you away

00:44:38.650 --> 00:44:40.330
Forget everything

00:44:39.780 --> 00:44:47.260
I kept looking for the way to you, but I never found it

00:44:41.480 --> 00:44:43.060
And about the throne and about me

00:44:44.440 --> 00:44:49.660
If you don't leave this place,
you can't avoid suffering

00:44:47.260 --> 00:44:55.160
I couldn’t catch the fate that was moving away from me

00:44:50.430 --> 00:44:51.630
you

00:44:53.720 --> 00:44:55.120
must give up first

00:44:55.480 --> 00:45:00.230
So I'll let you go completely

00:45:00.230 --> 00:45:06.180
Looking at your footprints when you leave me

00:45:06.180 --> 00:45:14.920
Now I couldn’t hold back my tears

00:45:15.880 --> 00:45:21.220
I was like a fallen petal

00:45:21.580 --> 00:45:28.240
I was sad because I had to end it all like this

00:45:29.180 --> 00:45:37.380
And if we meet again one day

00:45:37.380 --> 00:45:41.880
Then we won’t say goodbye to you

00:45:42.200 --> 00:45:44.660
Love

00:45:45.340 --> 00:45:47.520
mine

00:45:54.860 --> 00:45:57.710
You have to help me brother

00:46:14.710 --> 00:46:16.940
Do you have something to tell me?

00:46:18.380 --> 00:46:20.450
The Empress desperately begged me for this

00:46:20.980 --> 00:46:22.380
So I made an exception

00:46:23.150 --> 00:46:26.190
Your Majesty, please wait outside

00:46:27.980 --> 00:46:29.120
Brother

00:46:37.570 --> 00:46:39.630
I can't ask for anything else

00:46:40.690 --> 00:46:44.490
Please listen to the end of what he has to say.

00:46:57.370 --> 00:46:58.400
I...

00:47:02.120 --> 00:47:05.410
I have to confess about my relationship with Hae Soo

00:47:08.470 --> 00:47:09.590
Hae Soo?

00:47:09.590 --> 00:47:14.300
Looks like there's something you still don't know about, Your Majesty.

00:47:14.300 --> 00:47:16.280
I thought I should tell you about this

00:47:18.800 --> 00:47:20.160
The two of us...

00:47:23.460 --> 00:47:25.380
promised each other to marry

00:47:30.950 --> 00:47:35.380
Do you seriously want to die?

00:47:35.380 --> 00:47:37.680
It was long before she became your woman

00:47:41.500 --> 00:47:42.650
Su...

00:47:44.850 --> 00:47:46.650
was my man

00:48:03.710 --> 00:48:07.030
I found out why you were so worried about Uka

00:48:09.490 --> 00:48:12.380
Why did you get down on your knees and beg for him?

00:48:14.230 --> 00:48:15.770
Now I know

00:48:19.500 --> 00:48:21.790
That bracelet you've been wearing for so long

00:48:22.520 --> 00:48:24.710
secret meetings in Damiwon...

00:48:26.470 --> 00:48:27.870
Is this true?

00:48:29.490 --> 00:48:34.220
Did you really want to marry Wook?

00:48:37.390 --> 00:48:38.390
Yes

00:48:40.870 --> 00:48:43.330
You told me that you had a loved one...

00:48:45.040 --> 00:48:46.470
Was this person Uk?

00:48:50.430 --> 00:48:52.010
Yes it was him

00:48:58.690 --> 00:49:01.810
I like another person

00:49:01.810 --> 00:49:05.060
- Beck A?
- No, not Baek A

00:49:05.060 --> 00:49:06.450
I'll take her back

00:49:06.450 --> 00:49:10.320
If someone sees you two together, rumors will start

00:49:10.320 --> 00:49:11.460
Su!

00:49:14.880 --> 00:49:18.700
Nothing here belongs to you

00:49:18.700 --> 00:49:21.500
Neither Yong Hwa nor Hae Soo

00:49:22.570 --> 00:49:23.870
They are mine

00:49:25.050 --> 00:49:26.230
Your Majesty!

00:49:26.230 --> 00:49:29.020
You said you wouldn't hurt
harm to your brothers

00:49:32.580 --> 00:49:34.270
Then instead of this just lie to me

00:49:34.780 --> 00:49:39.180
Tell me it's a misunderstanding and that Wook is lying to me!

00:49:41.060 --> 00:49:43.160
Then everything will be the same for us

00:49:44.350 --> 00:49:45.450
We promised...

00:49:49.180 --> 00:49:51.310
don't lie to each other

00:49:52.120 --> 00:49:53.600
How could you do this?

00:49:55.030 --> 00:49:57.280
Why did you hurt me this way?

00:49:57.280 --> 00:49:59.300
Why, of all people, Uk?!

00:50:08.480 --> 00:50:10.920
He was always in your heart

00:50:11.420 --> 00:50:12.730
Your Majesty...

00:50:16.500 --> 00:50:18.160
Don't touch me!

00:50:20.790 --> 00:50:22.370
From today...

00:50:25.440 --> 00:50:27.610
I will never see you again

00:50:55.180 --> 00:50:58.180
Will you hear him?

00:50:58.430 --> 00:51:03.730
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:51:05.180 --> 00:51:07.630
Are you still listening?

00:51:07.630 --> 00:51:11.780
Can you hear my heart?

00:51:13.630 --> 00:51:17.900
How raindrops settled on the window

00:51:18.580 --> 00:51:24.350
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:51:25.100 --> 00:51:26.550
Need you

00:51:27.650 --> 00:51:29.230
Need you

00:51:30.230 --> 00:51:32.500
I miss you

00:52:08.350 --> 00:52:10.810
It was enough to give it up once

00:52:12.360 --> 00:52:16.040
I know they say you have to give up something to protect your position.

00:52:16.040 --> 00:52:20.200
But if you leave her like this, you will lose not only her, but also yourself.

00:52:24.080 --> 00:52:25.760
I didn't leave her

00:52:29.810 --> 00:52:32.810
Will you hear him?

00:52:33.060 --> 00:52:38.360
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:52:34.930 --> 00:52:36.090
Su...

00:52:38.080 --> 00:52:39.530
abandoned me

00:52:39.810 --> 00:52:42.260
Are you still listening?

00:52:42.260 --> 00:52:46.410
Can you hear my heart?

00:52:48.260 --> 00:52:52.530
How raindrops settled on the window

00:52:53.210 --> 00:52:58.980
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:52:55.110 --> 00:52:56.370
Bring it here

00:52:59.730 --> 00:53:01.180
Need you

00:53:01.870 --> 00:53:05.560
We became friends by drinking with each other
therefore, when parting, they should drink a cup

00:53:02.280 --> 00:53:03.860
Need you

00:53:04.860 --> 00:53:07.130
I miss you

00:53:07.860 --> 00:53:13.140
If I had any idea about Jeong's plan,
I wouldn't help you so easily

00:53:13.140 --> 00:53:14.800
I didn't know either

00:53:15.660 --> 00:53:19.270
He said he knew how to leave the palace.
That's all I knew

00:53:19.270 --> 00:53:21.240
You don't like this wedding either

00:53:22.400 --> 00:53:24.080
Then you should give it up

00:53:24.080 --> 00:53:25.980
I don't like the idea of this marriage

00:53:26.810 --> 00:53:29.310
But this is the only way I can leave the palace

00:53:30.580 --> 00:53:31.800
So I'll do it

00:53:34.450 --> 00:53:38.910
For that matter, I wanted
for you to stay with my brother

00:53:39.960 --> 00:53:42.420
Why are you trying to leave him

00:53:42.420 --> 00:53:44.810
knowing that you can't forget?

00:53:44.810 --> 00:53:48.040
There's too much blood in our relationship

00:53:48.920 --> 00:53:51.260
I thought I could stop it

00:53:50.740 --> 00:53:53.740
Will you hear him?

00:53:52.870 --> 00:53:54.110
But I was wrong

00:53:53.990 --> 00:53:59.290
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:53:56.710 --> 00:53:59.500
I'm not sure I can continue
stay nearby without interfering

00:53:59.500 --> 00:54:03.500
I don't know everything about your relationship

00:54:00.740 --> 00:54:03.190
Are you still listening?

00:54:03.190 --> 00:54:07.340
Can you hear my heart?

00:54:09.050 --> 00:54:11.700
It was a real blessing for me to become your friend

00:54:09.190 --> 00:54:13.460
How raindrops settled on the window

00:54:11.700 --> 00:54:15.760
Thanks to Ms. He, we have such a wonderful relationship.

00:54:14.140 --> 00:54:19.910
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:54:20.430 --> 00:54:24.870
Don't let yourself get sick from grief

00:54:20.660 --> 00:54:22.110
Need you

00:54:23.210 --> 00:54:24.790
Need you

00:54:25.790 --> 00:54:29.270
I miss you

00:54:38.610 --> 00:54:40.060
You have to go

00:54:41.280 --> 00:54:44.610
If you're late, I don't know what I'll do

00:54:45.210 --> 00:54:47.790
- What do the guards do?
- Prince Baek Ah

00:55:24.110 --> 00:55:25.500
Thank you

00:55:27.830 --> 00:55:30.240
I didn't do it with good intentions

00:55:30.240 --> 00:55:33.300
If you didn't know that I want to leave,

00:55:33.300 --> 00:55:37.420
you would never say that

00:55:39.110 --> 00:55:40.160
Jeong...

00:55:42.140 --> 00:55:43.390
will be good to you

00:55:46.540 --> 00:55:50.290
Please take care of yourself

00:55:52.190 --> 00:55:53.890
Since you're about to leave,

00:55:55.270 --> 00:55:57.100
cut off all the threads that bind you

00:56:00.860 --> 00:56:02.700
Forget everything that happened

00:56:06.100 --> 00:56:07.640
Think only about the future

00:56:10.230 --> 00:56:11.420
Only about this

00:56:34.120 --> 00:56:35.250
Su

00:56:41.180 --> 00:56:45.160
I think you understand me

00:56:46.920 --> 00:56:49.200
When I see you I

00:56:50.700 --> 00:56:54.010
I can’t breathe, I’m timid

00:56:54.200 --> 00:56:57.800
It's as if everything in the world has stopped

00:56:57.180 --> 00:56:58.370
Now you have to go

00:57:00.100 --> 00:57:04.700
If I pass by like a breeze,

00:57:04.700 --> 00:57:07.800
you won't even notice

00:57:08.500 --> 00:57:13.100
My heart is all given to you

00:57:15.000 --> 00:57:21.100
But loving you is very painful for me

00:57:15.820 --> 00:57:17.510
Our common destiny

00:57:21.100 --> 00:57:23.300
And so sad

00:57:22.750 --> 00:57:23.880
ended

00:57:23.300 --> 00:57:27.800
I need to cross you out of my heart

00:57:29.100 --> 00:57:30.700
so hard

00:57:32.900 --> 00:57:37.000
Don't forget, please!

00:57:37.870 --> 00:57:42.300
That eternal love of mine

00:57:49.700 --> 00:57:52.500
You burn with your gaze

00:57:53.300 --> 00:57:56.500
As if you know everything yourself

00:57:57.100 --> 00:58:00.700
About what's on my heart

00:58:02.850 --> 00:58:07.460
Even if I want to, I can’t leave

00:58:07.460 --> 00:58:10.550
Holds the memories

00:58:11.100 --> 00:58:15.400
Even when you and I are not around

00:58:17.600 --> 00:58:23.700
But loving you is very painful for me

00:58:23.700 --> 00:58:25.900
And so sad

00:58:25.900 --> 00:58:31.000
I need to cross you out of my heart

00:58:31.700 --> 00:58:33.300
so hard

00:58:33.420 --> 00:58:35.390
If I hadn't met him,

00:58:35.500 --> 00:58:39.600
Don't forget, please!

00:58:36.410 --> 00:58:38.940
I wouldn't miss him

00:58:40.470 --> 00:58:44.900
That eternal love of mine

00:58:40.690 --> 00:58:42.690
If I didn't know him,

00:58:43.210 --> 00:58:46.120
I wouldn't even think about him at all

00:58:46.120 --> 00:58:50.630
If we weren't together,
I wouldn't have to leave

00:58:47.100 --> 00:58:52.400
If you're late, it's okay

00:58:50.630 --> 00:58:54.950
If I didn't value him so much,
I wouldn't have so many memories

00:58:52.780 --> 00:58:55.540
By the will of fate

00:58:55.540 --> 00:59:02.800
Suddenly I will be able to meet you!

00:58:56.800 --> 00:58:58.840
If I didn't love him...

00:59:00.160 --> 00:59:03.340
we wouldn't have to give up on each other

00:59:04.790 --> 00:59:07.010
If we hadn't encountered him,

00:59:05.750 --> 00:59:11.200
And it’s still just as difficult for me to forget you

00:59:08.880 --> 00:59:11.520
we would never be together

00:59:11.800 --> 00:59:13.960
It's so hard for me

00:59:13.950 --> 00:59:15.180
Perhaps...

00:59:13.960 --> 00:59:20.500
This dream is bad, when I remember, I cry

00:59:17.280 --> 00:59:19.780
If I hadn't met you at all...

00:59:20.500 --> 00:59:21.590
always

00:59:23.810 --> 00:59:27.300
I believe once upon a time

00:59:28.500 --> 00:59:32.100
how I want to love

00:59:33.850 --> 00:59:35.300
I can

